=== Key Features ===

1. True growth mixture modeling with lcmm (not LPA)
2. Quadratic growth with class-specific trajectories
3. Robust convergence via gridsearch (100 random starts/model)
4. Parallel processing (11 cores) - 3x faster than sequential

